<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb zinc imports rise 12.0 pct yr/yr--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb zinc imports rise 12.0 pct yr/yr--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined zinc imports in February rose 12.0 percent to 7,940 tonnes from 7,089 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Ministry of Finance data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			 Feb 97    Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p> Total		 7,940     9,089	 7,089</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		 5,989     6,378	 3,294</p>
<p>Refined zinc imports in the first two months of calendar 1997 were 17,029 tonnes, up 11.7 percent from 15,241 tonnes during the same period last year.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
